WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.607 --> 00:00:02.787
- I'm gonna reach across.

00:00:02.787 --> 00:00:04.543
Hello, aaah! Aaah!

00:00:04.543 --> 00:00:05.626
Aaaah! Aaaah!

00:00:06.876 --> 00:00:07.711
Put me out now!

00:00:07.711 --> 00:00:08.628
Put me out!

00:00:10.274 --> 00:00:12.010
Good morning, my name is Rocky Taylor.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:14.593
I've been a stuntman for 54 years.

00:00:14.593 --> 00:00:16.426
I started around 1961.

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:21.707
(whimsical music)

00:00:21.707 --> 00:00:24.344
Yes, I'm the oldest
working stuntman, I s'pose.

00:00:24.344 --> 00:00:26.864
I was the youngest, now I'm the oldest.

00:00:26.864 --> 00:00:29.364
(jazzy music)

00:00:33.775 --> 00:00:35.855
Just sort of fell into it.

00:00:35.855 --> 00:00:39.380
I could fall about and do
what the actors couldn't do.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.998
I get punched, fall over a chair,

00:00:41.998 --> 00:00:44.698
dive and roll all over the ground.

00:00:44.698 --> 00:00:47.703
My first stunt job was a
film called The Young Ones

00:00:47.703 --> 00:00:49.703
with Sir Cliff Richards.

00:00:52.175 --> 00:00:53.452
They gave me a Guinness Record.

00:00:53.452 --> 00:00:54.932
I've got it over there.

00:00:54.932 --> 00:00:57.567
The oldest still-working
stuntman in England.

00:00:57.567 --> 00:01:00.830
The only stuntman to double
for two Bonds in one year,

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:01.663
Roger Moore.

00:01:01.663 --> 00:01:02.508
- The name is Bond.

00:01:02.508 --> 00:01:03.570
- [Rocky] And Sean Connery.

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:04.755
- James Bond.

00:01:04.755 --> 00:01:07.005
(grunting)

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:09.296
- My last film was this Sunday.

00:01:09.296 --> 00:01:11.464
I was working on a
little car chase sequence

00:01:11.464 --> 00:01:14.776
around Trafalgar Square, which was great.

00:01:14.776 --> 00:01:16.537
I mean, I've been in it
for so many years now,

00:01:16.537 --> 00:01:19.245
and I can't think of
anything else I could do.

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:21.995
(dramatic music)

00:01:25.255 --> 00:01:27.939
I had a very bad accident on Death Wish 3.

00:01:27.939 --> 00:01:29.672
I nearly got killed.

00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:31.505
This is the shot of me

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:36.386
doing the fall which nearly took my life.

00:01:36.386 --> 00:01:39.602
(explosions)

00:01:39.602 --> 00:01:42.154
Well, they blew it up
before I got to the edge.

00:01:42.154 --> 00:01:45.292
I run through the flames,
put my hands up over my eyes,

00:01:45.292 --> 00:01:48.950
came through, broke my back, pelvis.

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:50.398
Thank God I survived.

00:01:50.398 --> 00:01:53.448
I don't know how I survived.

00:01:53.448 --> 00:01:56.400
But you're gonna get a little
knock and a little bruise.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.150
Best part of the job.

00:02:01.915 --> 00:02:03.832
Why do I keep doing it?

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:06.418
I've had a great life.

00:02:06.418 --> 00:02:09.599
I've been 'round the world twice.

00:02:09.599 --> 00:02:11.516
I've met all the stars.

00:02:15.357 --> 00:02:16.634
I love it.

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:19.217
There's nothing else about it.

